'''Radiant Aphrodite''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 4.6 Update|Version 4.6]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during [[The Almighties The Majestic Zeus (Gacha Event)|The Almighties The Majestic Zeus]] event. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 9.10 Update|Version 9.10]] increases her health. [[Talents]] were also added in [[Version 9.10 Update|Version 9.10]], and Ultra Talents were added in [[Version 13.2 Update|Version 13.2]].

